      "text": "STEP 1: HAPLOTYPECALLER — LOCAL REASSEMBLY\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ For each genomic region with evidence of variation:     │\n  │ 1. Collect all reads overlapping the region             │\n  │ 2. REASSEMBLE reads using local de Bruijn graph         │\n  │    (avoids reference bias from alignment)               │\n  │ 3. Identify all candidate haplotypes in graph           │\n  │ 4. Score each read against each candidate haplotype     │\n  │    using pair-HMM (Hidden Markov Model)                 │\n  │ 5. Bayesian genotyping: P(G|D) for each genotype G      │\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-VARIANT-CALLING.md#012",
      "path": [
        "03-VARIANT-CALLING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:genomics:03-variant-calling, git-history:genomics:03-variant-calling]",
