        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Variant Calling and Population Genomics",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "THE HMM IN HAPLOTYPECALLER:\n  ─────────────────────────────\n  Models three processes simultaneously:\n    - Read bases matching the haplotype (match state M)\n    - Insertions in the read vs. haplotype (insert state I)\n    - Deletions in the read vs. haplotype (delete state D)"
    },
