      },
      "text": "STEP 3: GENOTYPEGVCFS (joint calling)\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Combine N sample GVCFs                                  │\n  │ Call genotypes jointly (uses all samples to calibrate)  │\n  │ Captures rare variants detectable only by seeing allele │\n  │ in the full cohort context                              │\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
